          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of буксовать (buksovát) is not settled. It is often linked with буксир 'a tug, a towrope', a sailors' word usually traced to Dutch; EtymDB does not list буксовать (buksovát)."
